# Conventional Commits: <type>: <summary>
# Optional scope: <type>(<scope>): <summary>
#
# feat: a new feature
# fix: a bug fix
# Other types may follow the repository's conventions, for example:
# docs, refactor, perf, test, build, ci, chore, style, revert.
#
# Optionally add a body after a blank line to explain the change.
# Put footers after another blank line.
#
# For a breaking change, put ! immediately before the colon and describe
# the breaking change in the summary, or add this footer:
# BREAKING CHANGE: <description of the breaking change>
#
# Specification: https://www.conventionalcommits.org/en/v1.0.0/
